sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title Approve and publish a submission
  participant U as Maintainer
  participant H as GitHub Actions
  participant S as Approve Script
  participant B as Build / Test
  participant P as GitHub Pages
  participant I as Issue
  U->>H: Trigger approve-submission
  H->>S: node scripts/approve-submission.mjs
  S->>S: recheck approval + security baseline
  S-->>H: updated registry source
  H->>B: npm run build + npm test
  B-->>H: pass
  H->>P: upload publication + Pages artifact
  H->>P: deploy
  H->>I: label listed + close
  P-->>U: Published catalog
  Note over H: Deployment only runs after build and tests pass.
